jjk.help.title=How to play
jjk.help.body=§bLimitless item§r~LINEBREAK~· Tap/use: enters and leaves combat mode~LINEBREAK~· Sneaking + use: opens this menu~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§bIn combat mode§r~LINEBREAK~· Slots 1-6: techniques (tap again to release Blue, Maximum Red and Maximum Blue)~LINEBREAK~· Slot 7: dodge toward the joystick direction~LINEBREAK~· Slot 8: toggle healing (Reverse Technique)~LINEBREAK~· Attack: 4-hit combo~LINEBREAK~· Sneak: guard (blocks hits from the front)~LINEBREAK~· During Maximum Blue, push the joystick forward/back to change its distance~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Earn XP by defeating mobs and using techniques. Command: §e/jjk:menu
