jjk.skill.infinity.name=Infinity
jjk.skill.infinity.desc=Toggle Infinity: projectiles slow down and stop before touching you, melee hits and outside explosions are blocked. Energy does not recover while active.
jjk.skill.infinity.stats=Energy %s to activate · %s/sec to maintain
jjk.skill.blue.name=Lapse: Blue
jjk.skill.blue.desc=Pulls a target in your aim toward you. Tap again before the pull to dash to the target, or fly toward your aim if there is no target.
jjk.skill.blue.stats=Energy %s · %s block range
jjk.skill.barrage.name=Barrage
jjk.skill.barrage.desc=Grabs the enemy in front and follows with rapid punches and a launching kick. Scales with Strength.
jjk.skill.barrage.stats=Free · %s base damage if every hit connects
jjk.skill.red.name=Reversal: Red
jjk.skill.red.desc=Releases a repulsive burst in front of you. Targets closer to the center take more damage and are knocked further.
jjk.skill.red.stats=Energy %s · %s–%s base damage
jjk.skill.purple.name=Hollow Purple
jjk.skill.purple.desc=Fuses Blue and Red into a projectile that erases everything in its path. Aim with the camera while charging; it fires when ready.
jjk.skill.purple.stats=Energy %s · %s base damage
jjk.skill.awakening.name=Awakening
jjk.skill.awakening.desc=Unlocks Maximum Blue, Maximum Red and the awakened Purple for a while. Use the slot again to cast Unlimited Void.
jjk.skill.awakening.stats=Energy %s · %ss duration
jjk.skill.max_blue.name=Maximum Output: Blue
jjk.skill.max_blue.desc=Creates a field that pulls enemies and blocks in. Tap again to cancel; let it finish to leave it in place. Push the joystick forward/back to change its distance.
jjk.skill.max_blue.stats=Energy %s · up to %s base damage per target
jjk.skill.max_red.name=Maximum Output: Red
jjk.skill.max_red.desc=Charge and aim; tap again to fire a devastating beam. Hitting your stationary Maximum Blue creates Self Purple.
jjk.skill.max_red.stats=Energy %s · %s base damage
jjk.skill.awakened_purple.name=Awakened Purple
jjk.skill.awakened_purple.desc=A stronger Purple. Right after creating Self Purple, use this slot before it detonates to trigger Nuke Purple.
jjk.skill.awakened_purple.stats=Energy %s · base %s · Self Purple %s dmg · Nuke +%s energy
jjk.skill.void.name=Unlimited Void
jjk.skill.void.desc=Once per Awakening: raises the barrier and takes everyone around you into the domain. Information overload paralyzes them.
jjk.skill.void.stats=Energy %s · %ss active inside
jjk.skill.dodge.name=Dodge
jjk.skill.dodge.desc=Rolls toward the joystick direction (back when idle). Invulnerable while rolling; also escapes stuns.
jjk.skill.dodge.stats=2 s cooldown · stun escape: 12 s
jjk.skill.rct.name=Reverse Cursed Technique
jjk.skill.rct.desc=Toggles healing: restores health using cursed energy once per second.
jjk.skill.rct.stats=Heals %s hearts for %s cursed energy
